### List import machine reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/import_machine_reports
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Upload sample-report.fusion-data (JSON machine report)
POST {{baseUrl}}/import_machine_reports
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source_machine"

Inficon GC
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_id"

1
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="instrument"

Inficon 1 GC
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="last_instrument_verification"

25-10-2026
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="heating_method"

Oven & Heat Trace
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hexanes_split"

60/30/10 (C6/C7/C8)
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sample_method"

Purge & Fill
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="effective_start_date"

01-05-2026
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="effective_end_date"

31-05-2026
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-report.fusion-data"
Content-Type: application/json

< D:\Projects\LIMS-Backend\uploads\machine_reports\sample-report.fusion-data

------FormBoundary--


